This project contains an adapted implementation of the WaSR and eWaSR network
architectures from:

  Matija Tersek, Lojze Zust, Matej Kristan
  "eWaSR -- an embedded-compute-ready maritime obstacle detection network"
  https://github.com/tersekmatija/eWaSR

The upstream project is Copyright 2023 Tersek Matija and licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. The implementation in models/student.py was changed
to use a modern torchvision API, remove PyTorch Lightning/timm dependencies,
support direct tensor inputs and full-resolution outputs, and expose intermediate
features for knowledge distillation.

